# Line endings are decided here, not by each contributor's core.autocrlf.
# Git normalises to LF in the repository; checkouts get the platform's own.
# Without this, a Windows clone with autocrlf unset commits CRLF and every
# later diff is the whole file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Nothing here is binary today, but brand artwork lands in a gitignored
# directory and captures are JSONL, so this is the shape to extend if that
# ever changes.
